<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>工作台 - 内部运营系统</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="layout-wrapper">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-brand">
        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock me-2"></i>运营系统
      </div>
      <ul class="nav flex-column" id="sidebar-menu"></ul>
    </aside>
    <div class="main-content">
      <div class="topbar">
        <h1><i class="bi bi-speedometer2 me-2"></i>工作台</h1>
        <div class="user-section">
          <div id="user-info"></div>
          <a href="#" id="logout-btn" class="btn-logout">
            <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-1"></i>退出
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="alert-box alert-box-info">
        <i class="bi bi-info-circle fs-5"></i>
        <div>
          <strong>欢迎使用内部运营系统！</strong>
          系统已集成完整的权限控制，包括菜单权限、数据权限和越权防护。
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>客户总数</h3>
          <div class="stat-value" id="stat-customers">--</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>今日新增</h3>
          <div class="stat-value">0</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>待跟进</h3>
          <div class="stat-value">0</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <h3>本月成交</h3>
          <div class="stat-value">0</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="mb-4"><i class="bi bi-shield-check me-2"></i>安全特性说明</h3>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="alert-box alert-box-success">
              <i class="bi bi-key fs-4"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>双 Token 认证</strong><br>
                Access Token(15分钟) + Refresh Token(7天)，自动刷新无感续期
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="alert-box alert-box-warning">
              <i class="bi bi-list-check fs-4"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>菜单权限控制</strong><br>
                根据用户角色动态渲染菜单，无权限菜单不可见
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="alert-box alert-box-info">
              <i class="bi bi-database-lock fs-4"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>行级数据权限</strong><br>
                all/team/self 三级数据范围，自动过滤无权数据
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="alert-box alert-box-danger">
              <i class="bi bi-slash-circle fs-4"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>IDOR 越权防护</strong><br>
                查询时自动校验数据归属，防止通过 ID 越权访问
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3 class="mb-4"><i class="bi bi-people me-2"></i>测试账号</h3>
        <table class="table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>账号</th>
              <th>密码</th>
              <th>角色</th>
              <th>数据权限</th>
              <th>说明</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>admin</td><td>123456</td><td><span class="badge badge-info">超级管理员</span></td><td><span class="data-scope-badge scope-all">全部</span></td><td>可访问所有菜单和数据</td></tr>
            <tr><td>director</td><td>123456</td><td><span class="badge badge-info">销售总监</span></td><td><span class="data-scope-badge scope-all">全部</span></td><td>可访问工作台和客户管理</td></tr>
            <tr><td>manager1</td><td>123456</td><td><span class="badge badge-warning">销售主管</span></td><td><span class="data-scope-badge scope-team">团队</span></td><td>可查看团队所有客户</td></tr>
            <tr><td>sales1</td><td>123456</td><td><span class="badge badge-success">普通销售</span></td><td><span class="data-scope-badge scope-self">个人</span></td><td>只能查看自己的客户</td></tr>
            <tr><td>sales2</td><td>123456</td><td><span class="badge badge-success">普通销售</span></td><td><span class="data-scope-badge scope-self">个人</span></td><td>只能查看自己的客户</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
  <script>
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', async () => {
      const result = await API.getCustomers();
      if (result && result.data) {
        document.getElementById('stat-customers').textContent = result.data.length;
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
